# Versification "SYN": the stored Synodal `syn` against rso.vrs.
# Bible-API correction file, checked 2026-11-02 against cep_public
# translation 1 (verse texts). A mapping replaces the base mapping of its
# verse; a `-` line marks verses with no original counterpart.
#
# rso.vrs maps Isaiah 3:20-25 one verse short: syn 3:20 «перстни и кольца
# в носу» is the original 3:21, 3:24 «Мужи твои падут от меча» its 3:25.
ISA 3:20-25 = ISA 3:21-26
# Daniel 5:31-6:28 is numbered as in English Bibles (5:31 «Дарий Мидянин»).
DAN 5:31 = DAN 6:1
DAN 6:1-28 = DAN 6:2-29
# Septuagint additions (bracketed in the text) with no original counterpart.
-PRO 13:14
-PRO 18:8
# Textus Receptus order: Philippians 1:16 and 1:17 change places.
PHP 1:16 = PHP 1:17
PHP 1:17 = PHP 1:16
# Revelation 20:7 includes the original 20:8, whose 20:9 is 20:8-9 here.
REV 20:7 = REV 20:7-8
REV 20:8-9 = REV 20:9
